# AccessBuddy

Multi-tenant club access & credential management SaaS. Live at accessbuddy.com.au.

- **Type:** Code product (live)
- **Stack:** Next.js, Bun, Hono, Postgres, GCP (Cloud Run, Cloud SQL), Stripe Connect, Firebase Auth, GitHub Actions
- **Code source:** `/Users/nicholaswood/dev/accessbuddy` (git repo) — to be consolidated into `code/`
- **Status:** v1.10.2 in production, post cost-optimisation

## How this folder works
- `CLAUDE.md` — operator brief, auto-loaded when working here
- `context/` — shared memory + live state, read by all agents
- `agents/<name>/` — each agent has its own `claude.md` + `memory.md` (see AGENT_STANDARD.md)
- `code/` — the app repo (migration target)

## Agents
| Agent | Scope |
|---|---|
| `architect` | System/technical architecture, data-model & integration design (base: Architect) |
| `feature-dev` | Member/admin UI, credentials, notifications, workflow, payments features |
| `infra-ops` | Terraform, GCP, Cloud Run, cost control, CI/CD, env vars |
| `qa-verify` | Browser verification, deploy checks, regression testing before "done" |
